        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Emerging Markets Review - African Financial Research]]></title>
            <link>https://hubecall.com/call/elsevier-call-for-african-financial-research-proposals-emerging-markets-review</link>
            <guid>elsevier-call-for-african-financial-research-proposals-emerging-markets-review</guid>
            <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 10:27:21 GMT</pubDate>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<div>
    
    
    <p>This call invites research proposals focused on African financial markets and emerging markets research. The journal seeks high-quality submissions that advance our understanding of financial phenomena in African contexts and emerging market economies.</p>
    
    
    <h2>Potential topics</h2>
    <ul>
        
        <li>African financial markets</li>
        
        <li>Emerging markets research</li>
        
        <li>Financial economics in Africa</li>
        
    </ul>
    
    
    <h2>Timeline</h2>
    <ul>
        
        <li>May 30, 2027: Submission deadline</li>
        
    </ul>
    
    
</div>]]></content:encoded>
            <author>Emerging Markets Review (ELSEVIER)</author>
        </item>
